Z||000000||billfredmike24||08-23-2001||12:40 PM||||Don't know if this has been covered or not, but, i was watching Motoring 2001 on TSN(canadian) and what they were doing is riding in an unmarked police car on Toronto's highways looking for dangerous drivers, speeders, etc.  Just cruising down the highway at about 120km/h a black fiero fastback comes flying up past' em makes three lane changes, no blinkers, so he pulls them over.  Fiero puts blinker on and pulls over, Cop says "I guess his blinkers do work".  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  Cop goes up to the car, it's got a big "RSM Motorsports" sticker across the windshield, turns out to be a short blond chick.  Gets license, registration goes back to car, runs through the cpu, turns out she had a suspended license since 1998 and decided not to renew it.  Next shot is of the fiero being towed away, front wheels up  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"> lol.||||reg||14
Z||000001||artherd||08-24-2001||12:43 PM||||!!  She must have been speeding to the shop to fix her shorting plug wire!!<P>Good thing she was out of nitrous :)<P>Best!<BR>'Ben<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.cartsys.com/fiero/88ttop.jpg">  <BR>Ben Cannon<BR>88 Formula, T-top Metalic Red<BR>88 Formula, Silver<BR>87 Coupe, Metalic Red<BR>"Every Man Dies, not every man really Lives"<BR>                -Mel Gibson, "Braveheart"||||reg||3
